    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Fetching Mountain instead of Island is a significant mistake. The player's hand contains Back to Basics, Flame of Anor, Dress Down, and Swords to Plowshares. Back to Basics requires UUU-heavy mana and punishes nonbasic lands - it's the key card against the opponent's Underground Sea / Badlands mana base. Having a basic Island would provide blue mana for Back to Basics (which costs 2U), Dress Down (1U), and Flame of Anor (1UR). The player already has Tundra for white mana (Swords to Plowshares). Getting a Mountain only helps cast Flame of Anor's red requirement, but an Island is far more important since the player needs UU or more blue sources for their key spells, and importantly, fetching Island means they can cast Back to Basics on turn 3 with Tundra + Island + Prismatic Vista (if they play it), while still being able to untap all their lands since they'd all be basics (except Tundra which taps for U). With Mountain, they have a harder time casting their blue-heavy spells and Back to Basics specifically.",
      "action_taken": "Fetched Mountain with Prismatic Vista",
      "better_line": "Fetch Island to support casting Back to Basics on turn 3 (the most impactful card in hand against opponent's nonbasic-heavy mana base) and to better support the blue-heavy spell suite (Dress Down, Flame of Anor's draw mode)",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 30,
      "player": "Grk41F Humble",
      "decision_index": 18,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "With the opponent tapped out and Force of Negation already in the graveyard, this was the perfect window to execute the LED + Beseech the Mirror combo. Play Verdant Catacombs, fetch a land, cast Beseech the Mirror, hold priority to crack LED (discarding hand doesn't matter since Beseech is on the stack), and sacrifice LED as Bargain to cast any CMC ≤4 card for free. Instead, Brainstorm was cast, which delays the combo and gives the opponent time to find answers.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Brainstorm instead of executing the Beseech the Mirror + LED combo line",
      "better_line": "Play Verdant Catacombs, fetch a Swamp/dual, cast Beseech the Mirror (holding priority to activate LED for BBB, discarding hand), sacrifice LED to Bargain, and tutor for and cast a game-winning card at CMC ≤4 for free while opponent is completely tapped out with no countermagic available.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 48,
