      "decision_index": 23,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Gem3F Vet passed without casting Beseech the Mirror when the opponent had no counterspells available (Force of Negation was discarded to Thoughtseize, all lands tapped). They had the mana to cast it: Badlands for {B}, then crack LED for {B}{B}{B} while Beseech is on the stack, sacrificing Mox Opal to Bargain. This would let them tutor for and cast any 4-CMC-or-less card for free, potentially winning the game on the spot.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without casting any spells, leaving Beseech the Mirror, LED, and the combo line unused.",
      "better_line": "Cast Beseech the Mirror (tap Badlands for B, hold priority, crack LED for BBB discarding hand), sacrifice Mox Opal to Bargain, and tutor for the deck's key combo piece to cast for free while the opponent has no interaction available.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 58,
